  "body": "As the algorithm of constructor has been updated to make URLSearchParams constructor always have an init parameter at #334, should we also update the `WebIDL` of it to not have `optional`?\r\n\r\n```diff\r\n- [Constructor(optional (sequence<sequence<USVString>> or record<USVString, USVString> or USVString) init = \"\"),\r\n+ [Constructor((sequence<sequence<USVString>> or record<USVString, USVString> or USVString) init = \"\"), \r\n```",
